XIO ABI CONTRACT

Every target backend defines:

    integer argument registers
    floating argument registers
    return registers
    caller saved registers
    callee saved registers
    stack alignment
    stack growth
    frame layout
    aggregate passing
    aggregate return
    variadic handling
    syscall convention
    interrupt convention
    kernel convention

Backend must reject:
    unknown target
    unsupported ABI
    invalid register
    invalid alignment
    invalid instruction
    impossible register allocation
    invalid relocation
